   "lines": [
    "Went to the Patriarch",
    "Ball which was",
    "great fun; Corinne",
    "was a great belle",
    "and my own",
    "sweet little mistress",
    "had a great deal",
    "of attention. I had",
    "some superb waltzes",
    "with Lucy Tuckerman,",
    "Emily Post, & Miss",
    "Livingstone."
